r, `parse_checks`, `parse_column_comments`, the identifier check and rewrite functions, and `sql_ends_in_line_comment`.\n- **`sqlite_utils/db.py`:**\n  - `create_table_sql` has the new `_checks` and `_column_comments` parameters.\n  - `Table` has `checks`, `column_checks` and `table_checks`.\n  - `transform_sql` carries constraints and comments across, renames columns inside CHECK expressions, and refuses to drop a column a remaining constraint uses.\n\nI typed the SQLite keyword list by hand because this SQLite build doesn't expose `pragma_keyword_list`. It may differ slightly from SQLite's own list.\n\n`ruff`, `black` and `mypy` aren't installed in `.venv`, so I didn't run lint or type checks.\n\nAn `IN ()` check with no values gets `options=None`; the spec doesn't say what to return there.", "ttft_ms": 2974, "type": "result", "duration_ms": 143456, "uuid": "5b322d3f-aad4-46f4-8e67-e1d574609379", "ttft_stream_ms": 2515, "time_to_request_ms": 57, "first_content_frame_ms": 2515, "queued_turn_count": 0, "result_index": 0}
